Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.01,0:00:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under the all-powerful\NAdministrator's rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this world entered a long period of\Npeace and the people became apathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.83,0:00:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seventy years had passed since\NQuinella became Administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, one day, she realized\Nshe'd undergone a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She used her control command\Nto examine her Fluctlight and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,discovered it had reached its\Ncapacity to retain her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.59,0:00:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She refused to accept it, so she came\Nup with another monstrous solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.17,0:00:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can overwrite her Fluctlight with a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.37,0:00:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,copy of the thoughts and\Nmemories from my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.43,0:00:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.11,0:01:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a diabolical ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fusing of soul and memory, which\Nshe called the Synthesis Ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With it, she could seize control\Nof another human's Fluctlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here was where Administrator, or\NQuinella, made a critical mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.51,0:01:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't occur to her\Nthat during the process of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taking over the young girl\Nand deleting her old self,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there would be a split\Nsecond where two gods
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with equal power existed at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, you are familiar with my\Noriginal version, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.35,0:01:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the main feature\Nof the cardinal system?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, it's supposed to operate\Nautomatically for long periods of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.01,0:01:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't need humans to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.83,0:01:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.91,0:01:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to facilitate it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.49,0:01:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Cardinal System has two core programs,\Na main process and a sub-process.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.33,0:02:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The main process performs\Nbalance controls on the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.11,0:02:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While the sub-process runs\Nerror checks on the main.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When she became administrator,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.45,0:02:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the preservation of order wasn't the only
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.45,0:02:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing Queeniella etched\Nonto her Fluctlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.77,0:02:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the recesses of her soul, I still\Nfunctioned as the sub-process to her main.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was obligated to correct her errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.77,0:02:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 70 long years, I\Nwaited for my opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And finally, it had arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.37,0:02:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,вод
