Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.59,0:04:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.33,0:04:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little girl's Fluctlight is mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate luminous element.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.79,0:04:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Discharge! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.95,0:04:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate luminous element. System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate umbra element.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ball shape. Discharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Redefine object.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.85,0:04:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sword class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Redefine object.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.73,0:04:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rod class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call. Change. Field. Attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She made this area off-limits\Nfor System Commands!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't defeat her in this body!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.71,0:05:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System Call!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate Aerial Elements!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.37,0:05:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stream Shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are only two locations in this world\Nwhich Administrator has no control over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.03,0:05:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One is the other side\Nof the End Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.57,0:05:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.53,0:05:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate Aincrad Gate! Zero-one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Great Library!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In an instant, this space was\Ncompletely isolated from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the past 200 years, I've\Nbeen watching and plotting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I waited for the perfect moment, when I\Ncould catch her off guard, then ambush her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She knew what I was up to\Nand was constantly on guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so she created powerful and\Nloyal servants for protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the Synthesis Ritual,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this man will be reborn as a\Nwarrior devoted only to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my Integrity Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first one she turned into\Nan Integrity Knight was an
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exceptional swordsman who\Nhated the rule of the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.33,0:06:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeking refuge from it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he and his companions founded\Na village in the outer regions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.07,0:07:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of this knight\Nwas Bercouli Synthesis 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One-on-one, Administrator\Nand I are equally matched.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.89,0:07:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her knights are fast and powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They made the prospect of\Nambushing her impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, at the risk of being spotted,\NI sought out my own allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.79,0:07:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I opened doorways far from the cathedral,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then cast sensory-sharing\Nspells upon birds and insects
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and sent them out to lead\Npotential allies back here to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.99,0:07:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet Charlotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.77,0:07:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She spotted you and Eugeo\Nin Rulid and has been
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.93,0:07:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tagging along with you ever\Nsince you left that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, she did more\Nthan just tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was the one guiding me when\Nwe were running from that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, sneaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So back when my Zophilias got chopped\Nup, was that you giving me the pep talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a shy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.43,0:08:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all my observation units,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.75,0:08:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charlotte has been out searching\Nlonger than the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.83,0:08:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, she can rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.11,0:08:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her mission's come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I enlisted her, I froze the\Nnatural degradation of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.53,0:08:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was over 200 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Charlotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.65,0:08:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So for 200 years, you had critters like\Nher out in the world looking for help,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.69,0:08:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you've been stuck\Nin here the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.81,0:08:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as I sat here, observing\Nthe world through their eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a question kept repeating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.95,0:08:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would the gods of the\Noutside abandon a world they
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,created to suffer under the\Ntyranny of Administrator,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a false god.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.53,0:08:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I pondered this and\Nreferred to the Cardinal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System's built-in database over and over,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.35,0:08:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I eventually arrived at a conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrath may be the god here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't want the people\Nto lead happy lives at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wants the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.67,0:09:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrath created the underworld\Nso they can observe how
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its people react to stress\Nperimeters put upon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Day by day, they increase.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all those stressors\Nwill reach their limit,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the final phase of\Nthe test will be at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.61,0:09:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.99,0:09:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What these people fear the most, an\Ninvasion from outside this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Territory. Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The World of Darkness\Nwas created to subject
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.19,0:09:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Underworldians to the ultimate agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.67,0:09:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monsters there have\NFluctlights just like humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The difference is, their prime\Ndirective is to plunder and slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.99,0:09:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're eager for the day when they\Ncan breach the land of the Eums,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as they call you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and wreak havoc.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.85,0:10:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Administrator, does\Nshe know they're coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but she underestimates them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She thinks she and her Integrity\NKnights are strong enough to repel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She even had all four guardian dragons\Nslain, north, south, east, and west.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As allies, they would have been\Nvaluable, but she could not control them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.67,0:10:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity, she cannot win now, for the\Nforces of darkness are too many,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and her numbers are too few. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then why\Nbother taking her down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it sounds like the fate of this\Nworld sealed whether you do or don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.27,0:10:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Dark Territory will invade the human\Nrealm, and there is no stopping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, like, once you stop Administrator,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your job here is done and\Nwhatever else happens, happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't care, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrath engineered the\Nbloodshed that is to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.49,0:11:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot accept a god who does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I learned the load test\Nwas unavoidable, I decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The human realm and the dark territory\Nmust be returned to nothingness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up. Decided?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.59,0:11:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I regain control,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will access the flux light\Nstored in the light cube cluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.99,0:11:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I will delete every resident of\Nthe realms of humanity and darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.81,0:11:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you decide to help me, and\NI eliminate Administrator,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will have full access\Nto all of my authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.03,0:11:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, before I extinguish this\Nworld, I can grant you one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To a certain degree, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you single out those\Nyou would like to save,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will refrain from\Ndeleting their floodlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.39,0:11:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, I will archive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.77,0:12:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you escape to the real world,\Nyou can save their light cubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be able to set aside ten or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something doesn't add up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said your soul's a copy of hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.27,0:12:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means you got the selfish\Npart of the nobility in you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The drive to put your wants and\Nneeds above everyone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why'd you wait here all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for two hundred years?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.75,0:12:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have found a place far away from\NAdministrator and had some kind of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Cardinal's sub-process\Nwas burned into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means my core desires\Namount to only one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.09,0:12:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To eliminate Administrator and\Nrestore normal function here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.41,0:12:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is no way to have a\Nproperly functioning world unless
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.41,0:12:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the corrupting element is dealt\Nwith and the slate wiped clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, on second thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.97,0:13:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do harbor one desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something I was desperate to experience\Njust once for the last two hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.07,0:13:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, would you stand up, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.49,0:13:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, please step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come closer. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't argue with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise your arms, please. Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In front of you, and\Nmake a circle with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, how dense are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:13:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what it means to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.21,0:14:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be held.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.97,0:14:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so warm and comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After 200 years, this\Nmakes the wait worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think something so simple\Ncould be so satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.97,0:14:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wait was more than worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how long are you planning\Nto stand there like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.03,0:14:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, just being human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.07,0:14:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, what's your decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you help me stop\NAdministrator, or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you with this plan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.05,0:14:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I get where you're\Ncoming from and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.05,0:15:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not gonna give up on this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't give up on its people!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.43,0:15:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you, but I'll still\Ntry and find a way to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, your optimism is absurd?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.91,0:15:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if everything gets deleted, so do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't figure this out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can bet you'll be one of the\Nten people I'm gonna want saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you be any more foolish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you expect me to extinguish\Nthis world if I am not present?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To perform the task, don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'll do whatever you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.09,0:15:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm gonna try to come up With\Na better solution, all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.95,0:15:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday you too will know the\Nbitterness of resignation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.27,0:15:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is not the same as trying and Failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.89,0:15:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is being forced to admit failure\Nregardless of how hard you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.89,0:16:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought you were still in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.83,0:16:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I guess I lost track of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So uh, cardinal and I were talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.07,0:16:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She used to be the the pontifex\Nhere till administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kicked her out and took over her job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a Pontifex?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, she's on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gonna help us fight\Nthe Integrity Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will? Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.23,0:16:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she wants to get her\Ntitle as Pontifex back,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.69,0:16:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but to do that, she's gonna have\Nto take down Administrator first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, like, she sorta\Nsuggested we join forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.15,0:16:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's this girl, an Integrity\NKnight called Alice Synthesis 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she's the same person as an Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoo bird from rule? It do you know if\Nshe is? I'm sorry, but the information
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm able to access here is extremely\Nlimited i know integrity knight
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:17:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,alice was born but no other details\Nhowever i can tell you how to undo
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.19,0:17:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the synthesis ritual the sacred art\Nthat creates integrity knights and how
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.99,0:17:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do i do that simply remove the piety\Nmodule all the knights have one in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their forehead it looks like a
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,triangular prism we saw one once the piety
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,module is inserted it effectively\Nblocks the links to memories with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the prospective knight's past is\Nsealed away, the result is a knight who
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is loyal to the church and to their\Ncreator the pontifex we almost broke
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the spell on one of them we reminded\Nhim of who he used to be and the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.23,0:17:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crystal popped out. That is not enough\Nto free a knight. Another element is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,required in order to break the spell\Nand what would that be the thing that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once existed in the place where\Nthe module was inserted or more
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,specifically a memory fragment when\Nthe integrity knight treasures the most
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.95,0:18:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,administrator is a cautious woman i\Ndon't doubt she keeps all the memory
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fragments close at hand if anywhere\Nthey'd be in her chamber located on the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,top floor of the central cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.61,0:18:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so, to turn the knights\Nback to the way they were,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we need to get our hands\Non their memory fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.15,0:18:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I doubt the Integrity Knights are just
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going to let us walk up\Nto Administrator's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.73,0:18:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet we're going to have to fight every
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.59,0:18:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of them all the way to\Nthe top of the cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An Integrity Knight does not stop\Nuntil either you or they are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.41,0:18:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can help you get\Nequipment that is equal to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,theirs, but that is all\Nthe assistance I can offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest will be up to your skills and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.93,0:18:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whether you have the stamina to endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Alice shows up and I have to fight her,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to take her\Nback to our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.61,0:18:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:19:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your intention is honorable, and I\Nhave an idea that should satisfy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.69,0:19:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.13,0:19:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you come across Alice the Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.01,0:19:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll be armed with\Nsomething that won't kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.57,0:19:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made them special.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.03,0:19:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daggers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.41,0:19:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.32,0:19:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever they pierce will\Nbe instantly linked to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me in this library by an\Nunbreakable connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.73,0:19:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The person will then be susceptible\Nto whatever sacred art I cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.69,0:19:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is pierce her\Nflesh with just one of those daggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that instant, I will use my sacred\Narts to put her into a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.25,0:19:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She will stay that way\Nuntil you have her memory
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fragment and are ready\Nto remove the synthesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.95,0:19:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't manage to talk sense\Ninto her, I will use your daggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, one of those is\Nintended for administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other one is supposed to be a spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.03,0:19:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, who gets stabbed\Nwith which is up to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.35,0:19:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, talk about putting on the pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.01,0:19:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, we still need gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.15,0:20:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you'd help us get stuff\Nthat's equal to what the knights have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and Eugeo have powerful\Nswords of your own, do you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.09,0:20:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those should be more than\Nequal to what any knight has.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.11,0:20:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean what I think it does?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.11,0:20:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you get our swords back? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is an armory on the\Nthird floor of the cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.15,0:20:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is most likely where\Nthey are being kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, how far up do we have to\Ngo to get to Administrator's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.51,0:20:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each year, the central cathedral\Ngrows taller than the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.53,0:20:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, her chamber should be on\Nthe hundredth floor by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.37,0:20:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there is one\Nmore thing you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.31,0:20:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your swords are powerful,\Nthat much is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.11,0:20:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're not enough to bring\Ndown the Integrity Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.21,0:20:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They know a technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which allows them to\Namplify their weapons'
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.19,0:20:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,abilities many times over\Nwhat is normal. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.43,0:20:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it's called\NPerfect Weapon Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they activate the spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.83,0:21:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine Weapons take on the properties\Nof the thing the weapon once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.29,0:21:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, Perfect Control\Nreleases the weapon's memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.69,0:21:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a result, it can unleash potent\Nattacks that are far beyond normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.61,0:21:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will arm you both with that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.81,0:21:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes and think of your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.59,0:21:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.67,0:22:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, commit all the words to memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.21,0:22:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, Eugeo and Kirito, the\Nfate of this world is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.15,0:22:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether it is engulfed in\Nhellfire or vanishes entirely?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.92,0:22:24.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}If you're the sun burning red in the sky
Dialogue: 2,0:22:20.92,0:22:24.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(1880,25)}If you're the sun burning red in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.95,0:22:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or with any luck, perhaps\Nyou'll find a third path!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.69,0:22:28.43,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}Then I'm a blue flower blooming at night
Dialogue: 2,0:22:24.69,0:22:28.43,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(1880,25)}Then I'm a blue flower blooming at night
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.43,0:22:32.14,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}As I sway in the wind and look up at the sky
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.43,0:22:32.14,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(1880,25)}As I sway in the wind and look up at the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.45,0:22:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, I have told\Nyou all that I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.01,0:22:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And given you all that I can give.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.14,0:22:35.58,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}I find myself wetted by the morning dew
Dialogue: 2,0:22:32.14,0:22:35.58,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(1880,25)}I find myself wetted by the morning dew
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.58,0:22:39.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}I reach for you, and my hands grasp the air
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.58,0:22:39.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(1880,25)}I reach for you, and my hands grasp the air
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.87,0:22:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that is left is to\Ntrust in yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.09,0:22:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for all your help, Cardinal!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.48,0:22:43.31,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}But there you are smiling kindly down on me
Dialogue: 2,0:22:39.48,0:22:43.31,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(1880,25)}But there you are smiling kindly down on me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'll make it to\Nthe top of the cathedral.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.31,0:22:50.27,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}I hope to one day have the strength to protect someone like you do
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.31,0:22:50.27,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(1880,25)}I hope to one day have the strength to protect someone like you do
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.35,0:22:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And restore Alice's memory.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.27,0:22:58.12,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}You've always taken on my sadness and weakness
Dialogue: 2,0:22:50.27,0:22:58.12,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(1880,25)}You've always taken on my sadness and weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.95,0:22:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Ben. Off with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.12,0:23:05.05,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}Were you hiding the wounds that gave you all along?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:58.12,0:23:05.05,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(1880,25)}Were you hiding the wounds that gave you all along?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.05,0:23:09.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}When I can one day stop looking at you from over my shoulder
Dialogue: 2,0:23:05.05,0:23:09.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(1880,25)}When I can one day stop looking at you from over my shoulder
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.32,0:23:17.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}And feel your warmth from your side
Dialogue: 2,0:23:09.32,0:23:17.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(1880,25)}And feel your warmth from your side
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.72,0:23:27.04,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\c&HAE5725&\3c&HAE5725&\pos(1881,26)\bord1.4}I hope that I'll have been able to heal those wounds at least a bit
